{"id":"en_becoming-a-superstar-starts-with-breakup","title":"Becoming a Superstar Starts with Breakup","titleEn":"Becoming a Superstar Starts with Breakup","description":"After enduring 99 days of kneeling before his ex-wife, he gets a second chance at life and sets his sights on becoming a superstar. Confronted with many obstacles and openings, he takes part in \"The Voice,\" composes songs on the spot during performances, and demonstrates his abilities at a distinguished family banquet. Meanwhile, his tangled ties with his ex-wife, his friends, and his competitors bring emotional weight and tension to his rise toward fame.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/becoming-a-superstar-starts-with-breakup/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/becoming-a-superstar-starts-with-breakup/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Friends to Lovers","Historical","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsazw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_becoming-a-superstar-starts-with-breakup_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsazw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_becoming-a-superstar-starts-with-breakup_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsazw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_becoming-a-superstar-starts-with-breakup_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsazw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_becoming-a-superstar-starts-with-breakup_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":